<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry fair, demand light. Sales confirmed for the week to date on 2,600 head previously contracted or formulated cattle. Asking 64.00-65.00, bids not well established, few 62.00-63.00. Last sales Thursday, June 5 at 63.00. Sales FOB feedlot net weights after 4 percent shrink. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
